  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& W_{A B}=\\Delta Q-\\Delta U={ }^{\\prime} C_p d T-n C_v d T \\text { (at } \\\\\n& \\text { constant pressure }) \\\\\n& =n\\left(C_p-C_v\\right) d t \\\\\n& =n R d T=2 \\times R \\times(500-300)=400 \\mathrm{R}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/D_i9Os7KCdpdayR6IeU5E2c42VbTCObcGBxsjnx4J10.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
